      "rationale": "Gold #E6A817, navy #18222D, steel blue #3B5E82, off-white #F2F2F0, red #E5001A \u2014 confirmed from the logo, replacing earlier placeholder hex values. Brand anchors stay identical in light and dark mode."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_03_light_dark_mode",
      "label": "Light and dark mode with pre-paint resolution",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "source_file": "docs/03-design-system.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Default follows prefers-color-scheme; if unset default to dark. Explicit toggle choice persisted in localStorage (pishnam-theme) overrides system preference; apply as data-theme on html resolved before first paint to avoid a flash of wrong theme."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_03_rtl_first_logical_properties",
      "label": "RTL-first logical CSS properties",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "source_file": "docs/03-design-system.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Persian is primary, so build layout with ms-*/me-* and start/end instead of hardcoded left/right so English (ltr) pages mirror correctly without a second stylesheet."
    },
    {
